 {
  "name": "gmail_send_email",
  "description": "Send an email via Gmail. Composes and delivers a new outgoing Gmail message to one or more\nrecipients. Use this to send (not draft) an email — the message is\ntransmitted immediately and appears in the recipient's inbox. Handles\noutbound email dispatch, reply-and-send, forward-and-send, notification\n",
  "inputSchema": {
